  "issue_title": "Surface per-subnet validator/registration turnover in the Metagraph/Validators tab",
  "issue_body": "## Context\n\n`GET /api/v1/subnets/{netuid}/turnover` is already live: registered in `workers/api.mjs:1508` (`SUBNET_TURNOVER_PATH_PATTERN`) and handled by `handleSubnetTurnover` in `workers/request-handlers/entities.mjs:1330-1364`. It diffs a subnet's start/end `neuron_daily` snapshots over a `?window=7d|30d|90d|1y|all` to produce a validator-set + registration-churn scorecard (`src/turnover.mjs:126`, `buildTurnover`) \u2014 comparable-safe (single/cold snapshot returns a schema-stable zeroed block, never 404) and edge-cached like its sibling analytics routes. Nothing on the frontend references it: no `turnover` symbol exists anywhere under `apps/ui/src` \u2014 not in `apps/ui/src/routes/subnets.$netuid.tsx`, not in `apps/ui/src/lib/metagraphed/queries.ts`, not in `apps/ui/src/lib/metagraphed/types.ts`. Both the typed data layer and the UI surface are missing.\n\n## Requirement\n\nRender a validator-set/registration turnover scorecard on the subnet detail page's Metagraph tab, showing entered/exited validators, deregistered UIDs, retention ratios, and a stability score for the selected window \u2014 the first user-visible surface for this endpoint.\n\n## Backend\n\n- Endpoint: `GET /api/v1/subnets/{netuid}/turnover?window=7d|30d|90d|1y|all` (optional `&changes=true` for entered/exited hotkey + UID-reassignment detail \u2014 out of scope here, see Non-goals)\n- Query function: **none exists.** Grepping `Turnover`/`turnover` across `apps/ui/src/lib/metagraphed/queries.ts` and `apps/ui/src/lib/metagraphed/types.ts` returns zero hits. This PR must add:\n  - a `SubnetTurnover` interface in `apps/ui/src/lib/metagraphed/types.ts`, matching the response shape from `buildTurnover` (`src/turnover.mjs:126-204`): `schema_version`, `netuid`, `window`, `start_date`, `end_date`, `comparable`, `validators_start`, `validators_end`, `validators_entered`, `validators_exited`, `validator_retention`, `neurons_start`, `neurons_end`, `uids_deregistered`, `neuron_retention`, `stability_score`\n  - a `normalizeSubnetTurnover(netuid, raw)` + `subnetTurnoverQuery(netuid, window = \"30d\")` pair in `queries.ts`, following the exact `queryOptions`/`apiFetch`/normalize/`staleTime: STALE_MED` pattern used by the adjacent `subnetWeightsQuery` (`apps/ui/src/lib/metagraphed/queries.ts:3235-3247`) and `normalizeSubnetWeights` (`queries.ts:3222-3233`) \u2014 both the data-layer function and the UI wiring must land in one PR; a data-layer-only PR is exactly the failure mode this rewrite exists to prevent.\n\n## Deliverable\n\n- File(s) to change: `apps/ui/src/lib/metagraphed/types.ts` (new `SubnetTurnover` interface), `apps/ui/src/lib/metagraphed/queries.ts` (new `normalizeSubnetTurnover` + `subnetTurnoverQuery`), and `apps/ui/src/routes/subnets.$netuid.tsx` (new UI surface) \u2014 confirmed all three exist today and match the paths above.\n- Exact anchor: `MetagraphPanel` in `apps/ui/src/routes/subnets.$netuid.tsx:765-825` already renders two `SectionAnchor` blocks back to back \u2014 `id=\"metagraph\"` (the neuron table) and `id=\"concentration\"` (stake/emission distribution, delegating to `DistributionPanel`). Add a third `<SectionAnchor id=\"turnover\" title=\"Turnover\" ...>` immediately after the existing `concentration` anchor (i.e. as the last child of `MetagraphPanel`'s returned `<div className=\"space-y-6\">`), matching the two-line `subtitle`/`info` doc-comment style already used by its siblings (e.g. `info=\"GET /api/v1/subnets/{netuid}/concentration and /performance ...\"`). Register `turnover: \"metagraph\"` in the `SECTION_TO_TAB` map (`subnets.$netuid.tsx:155-175`) alongside the existing `metagraph: \"metagraph\"` / `concentration: \"metagraph\"` entries so hash-deep-links resolve to the right tab.\n- What to render: a `StatTile` grid (the idiom already imported and used by the sibling `ConcentrationLoader`, see `apps/ui/src/components/metagraphed/concentration-panel.tsx:10,73-90`) inside a new `TurnoverLoader`/`TurnoverPanel` component (co-locate in `concentration-panel.tsx` alongside `ConcentrationLoader`, or a new `turnover-panel.tsx` under `apps/ui/src/components/metagraphed/` \u2014 either is acceptable, match whichever keeps the diff smallest). Populate tiles from `subnetTurnoverQuery(netuid)`'s `data`: validators entered/exited (`validators_entered`, `validators_exited`), validator retention (`validator_retention`, 0-1 ratio), UIDs deregistered (`uids_deregistered`), neuron retention (`neuron_retention`), and a headline stability score (`stability_score`, 0-100). When `comparable === false` (cold store or single-snapshot window), render the empty/non-comparable state rather than zeroed tiles that read as \"flawless retention.\"\n- Coordination note: this section sits directly beside the existing `concentration` `SectionAnchor` inside the same `MetagraphPanel` function in `subnets.$netuid.tsx` \u2014 a PR touching this file for an unrelated Metagraph-tab change will likely produce adjacent diff hunks; rebase/coordinate rather than duplicating the anchor insertion point.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Diff touches at least one file under `apps/ui/src/routes/` or `apps/ui/src/components/` (not just `queries.ts`/`types.ts`)\n- [ ] `apps/ui/src/lib/metagraphed/queries.ts` gains a `subnetTurnoverQuery` (or equivalently named) query function calling `GET /api/v1/subnets/{netuid}/turnover`, and `apps/ui/src/lib/metagraphed/types.ts` gains a matching `SubnetTurnover` type\n- [ ] The new component imports and calls `subnetTurnoverQuery` via `useSuspenseQuery` (matching the Suspense-driven convention already used by every other panel in `MetagraphPanel`/`ValidatorsPanel`)\n- [ ] Renders at minimum: validators entered, validators exited, validator retention, UIDs deregistered, neuron retention, and stability score for the active window\n- [ ] A new `SectionAnchor id=\"turnover\"` is added inside `MetagraphPanel` (`apps/ui/src/routes/subnets.$netuid.tsx`), and `turnover: \"metagraph\"` is added to `SECTION_TO_TAB`\n- [ ] Loading state via `Suspense fallback={<Skeleton .../>}` (matching the sibling `concentration`/`metagraph` anchors), empty/non-comparable state via `TableState variant=\"empty\"` when `comparable === false` (matching `ConcentrationLoader`'s pattern at `concentration-panel.tsx:56-65`), and error state via the existing `QueryErrorBoundary` wrapper already used by every sibling panel \u2014 no new error-handling mechanism introduced\n\n## Non-goals\n\n- The `?changes=true` entered/exited-hotkey and UID-reassignment detail view (a drill-down list, not the scorecard) is not required by this issue \u2014 ship the scorecard only; a detail expansion can be a follow-up\n- Do not touch `ValidatorsPanel` (`subnets.$netuid.tsx:829-856`) or its `ValidatorsTableLoader` \u2014 this issue is scoped to the Metagraph-tab turnover scorecard, not the Validators tab's leaderboard table\n- Do not add a window selector UI beyond what's needed to pass `?window=` through \u2014 a full `WINDOWS` toggle (like `DistributionPanel`'s `ConcentrationLoader`/`PerformanceLoader` switch) is optional polish, not required for this issue\n\n## Size\n\nSize: S \u2014 keep this PR small (aim for \u226410 files / \u22641000 LOC).\n\nPart of #2542.",
